10 REM SHAPE TABLE DEMO - DRAW, XDRAW, ROT, SCALE, COLLISION
20 HGR
30 HCOLOR=3
40 T = 24576
50 FOR I = 0 TO 42: READ B: POKE T+I,B: NEXT
60 POKE 232,0: POKE 233,96
70 REM --- THE SAME FLAG AT THREE SCALES ---
80 ROT=0
90 SCALE=1: DRAW 1 AT 15,45
100 SCALE=2: DRAW 1 AT 40,60
110 SCALE=3: DRAW 1 AT 75,85
120 REM --- THE SAME FLAG AT FOUR QUARTER TURNS ---
130 SCALE=2
140 ROT=0:  DRAW 1 AT 170,75
150 ROT=16: DRAW 1 AT 215,50
160 ROT=32: DRAW 1 AT 265,50
170 ROT=48: DRAW 1 AT 265,120
180 REM --- XDRAW TWICE ERASES ITSELF, SO 30,170 STAYS EMPTY ---
190 SCALE=2: ROT=0
200 XDRAW 2 AT 30,170
210 XDRAW 2 AT 30,170
220 REM --- DRAWN ONCE, SO THIS ONE REMAINS ---
230 XDRAW 2 AT 80,170
240 REM --- COLLISION COUNTER: C1 IS 0, C2 COUNTS EVERY PIXEL HIT AGAIN ---
250 POKE 234,0
260 DRAW 2 AT 140,170
270 C1 = PEEK(234)
280 DRAW 2 AT 140,170
290 C2 = PEEK(234)
300 REM TYPE TEXT THEN PRINT C1;" ";C2 TO SEE THEM
310 END
